WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.639
What If Luffy Was Never Born In One Piece?

00:00:02.639 --> 00:00:04.500
What would have happened to all the straw
hats?

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.250
And who would have become pirate king in his
stead?

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:10.849
I spent accidentally spent an entire day I
was supposed to be working, playing through

00:00:10.849 --> 00:00:15.559
all the possible scenarios and discovered
one time line that seemed the most likely

00:00:15.559 --> 00:00:16.559
to me.

00:00:16.559 --> 00:00:21.060
And the results were so fascinating and tragic,
that i thought: why not turn this into a video!

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:25.170
Everything I’ll discuss will be based on
the manga and I swear, you will not be able

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:29.740
to guess who actually will be crowned pirate
king in Luffy’s stead in the end.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:32.070
So let’s start with Luffy’s childhood
years.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:36.590
If Dragon never got to find Luffy’s mysterious
mother and make the future pirate king, quite

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:41.820
a few things change in the years before the
main story line, but not quite as much as

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.010
you might think.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:46.780
For example, Garp will still be on Dawn Island,
looking after Roger’s son Ace.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:52.219
Ace will still meet Sabo, as he did without
Luffy anyways and both of them will train

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:56.239
together, fight together and share Sake cups
to become brothers.

00:00:56.239 --> 00:01:01.039
Trying to sail away, Sabo’s ship still gets
sunk by the celestial Dragons and he is once

00:01:01.039 --> 00:01:03.870
again rescued and taken in by Dragon.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:09.780
Maybe in this timeline he realized that having
a kid you never visit, is not a great idea.

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:14.960
The biggest change to the story of course,
are the events that happen in chapter 1: Shanks

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:20.070
still arrives in Fusha village, but never
gets to meet Luffy, who as a result doesn’t

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:25.390
eat the Gomu slash Nika fruit and thus never
becomes Joy Boy.

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:30.100
So here we have to make our first speculation,
that’s gonna have a major impact on how

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:35.200
this all plays out: What would have happened
with this legendary fruit instead?

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:39.540
And at this point I’m gonna make an assumption
that I believe is very likely to be true,

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:42.640
but not yet 100% confirmed in the story.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:46.600
If you have seen more of my content, you will
know, that I firmly believe that originally

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:51.990
Shanks was planning to give the Nika fruit
to none other than Ace, before Luffy simply

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:55.170
gobbled it down and made himself the new chosen
one.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:56.170
Let me explain.

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.969
Shanks clearly knew about the importance of
the Nika fruit.

00:01:58.969 --> 00:02:03.370
The government tried to get their hands on
it for centuries and once they finally did,

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:05.320
Shanks was there to take it away from them.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:09.929
We also know that Roger found out about Joy
Boy and his prophezised return on Laugh Tale.

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:15.500
He made sure to create the big pirate era
to draw out the right person and make sure

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.160
he would return.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:21.410
We know that he placed his former mate Crocus
at the entrance of the grand line to wait

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:23.209
for the right person to come.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:27.750
Crocus literally says ‘you might be the
one we have been waiting for Roger’ when

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.820
he meets Luffy.

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:34.250
And his right hand man Rayleigh is stationed
on Amazon Lily, the choke point you have to

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:36.460
pass in order to reach the new world.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:41.930
Rayleigh knew about Luffy from Shanks and
spent 2 years training Luffy to prepare him

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.060
for the second half of his journey.

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:49.550
When Luffy awakens his devil fruit, zunesha
takes his heartbeat as the sign of Joy Boy’s

00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:50.550
return.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:54.400
So I think it’s very likely that Shanks’
task as the crew member that Roger entrusted

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:59.530
his straw hat to, was to find the right person
to eat this fruit and guide his way to becoming

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:00.530
pirate king.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.129
Now, as we know, that is Luffy.

00:03:03.129 --> 00:03:07.989
But he ate the fruit by accident, and we also
know that Roger was eager to have a son before

00:03:07.989 --> 00:03:13.520
he died, which is Ace, a guaranteed member
of the D clan, just like Luffy.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:17.700
So I think, that Shanks went to Dawn Island
not on a fluke, but to give this legendary

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:23.260
devil fruit to Ace, the son of his former
captain and make him the next joy boy.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:29.600
And so if Luffy was never born, I believe
that exactly this would have happened.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.689
Shanks finds Ace and gives him the Nika fruit.

00:03:31.689 --> 00:03:36.110
He might even sacrifice his arm once again,
to make sure that Ace would try to become

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.910
a great pirate too.

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:41.049
After that however, I think that things would
stay quite similar.

00:03:41.049 --> 00:03:45.040
Shanks makes sure to watch over Ace from afar,
but lets him do his own thing.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:49.790
As a result, Ace becomes a pirate, becomes
captain of the spade pirates, gets defeated

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:53.579
by Whitebeard and joins his crew.

00:03:53.579 --> 00:03:57.920
Very much to the displeasure of Shanks, Rayleigh
and co, as Whitebeard doesn’t have any interest

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:03.110
in going to Laugh Tale, but also is too powerful
to be convinced otherwise, although not for

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:04.720
a lack of trying.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:10.220
So Ace becomes a strong pirate and commander
under Whitebeard, only that he has Rubber

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:12.209
powers instead of fire powers.

00:04:12.209 --> 00:04:17.780
But he’s quite smart as we know and figures
out how to use his fruit effectively.

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:21.970
Which now brings us to the current timeline
and the straw hats.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:26.910
If Luffy was never born, and never set out
to sea to gather his crew, what would have

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.160
happened to each of them?

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.889
As you’ll realize very quickly, there is
a reason why Luffy is the protagonist.

00:04:29.889 --> 00:04:31.919
Without him, things get quite dark.

00:04:31.919 --> 00:04:36.000
We start the east blue saga by going to Alvida’s
ship, where Luffy pops out of a barrel at

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.030
the beginning of the story to save Koby.

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:43.180
This time around however, there is nothing
in this barrel.

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:47.980
Koby will for the rest of his life be forced
to work the deck on the pirate’s ship.

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:53.810
He will never be inspired to follow his impossible
looking dream of becoming a marine admiral.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:59.180
As a result, neither he nor luffy make it
to Morgan’s Marine base, where Zoro is being

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:01.300
starved by Helmeppo.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:06.310
Without Luffy to rescue him, Zoro’s realizes
that Helmeppo never meant to stand by his

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:09.520
word to release him after 30 days without
food.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:15.120
instead Zoro, who at this point is too weak
to free himself, simply starves to death in

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.350
a horrifying and tragic manner.

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:21.280
The pitiful end of the future strongest swordsman
in the world.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:24.120
Mihawk never even learns his name.

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:29.530
In Orange Town, Buggy manages to reach the
grand line, but is soon captured by the marines

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:30.560
anyways.

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:36.340
Nami has barely managed to outwit Buggy and
escape him, even without Luffy’s help.

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:41.190
On Syrup village, Kuro’s 3 year plan to
plunder the island is finally complete.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:45.720
Despite Usopp’s warnings of pirates, no
one in the village believes him.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:51.220
Usopp wants to be brave and fight, but is
paralyzed by fear and he runs away.

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:55.810
Ultimately he and all the other villagers
are slaughtered by Kuro’s men, while his

00:05:55.810 --> 00:06:00.560
dad is having a party with Shanks somewhere
in the New World.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:03.550
. He will never become a brave warrior of
the sea.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:07.410
The only way to save Usopp is by subscribing
right now.

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:10.160
At the Baratie, things go a bit differently.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:15.710
While Luffy isn’t there to save the Baratie
from Don Krieg, when you think about it, Krieg

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:20.990
only survives Mihawk chasing after them because
Mihawk’s becomes more interested in Zoro

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:22.860
and his challenge.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:28.120
With Zoro still slowly wasting away in the
afternoon sun of Morgan’s base, Mihawk simply

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:31.590
finishes what he has come for all the way
from the grand line.

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:33.470
Sink the rest of Krieg’s ship.

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:38.639
So instead of the Baratie sinking, Mihawk
eats Krieg for lunch and then has a nice dinner

00:06:38.639 --> 00:06:41.090
with some good wine at the Baratie.

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:46.949
Sanji keeps working there happily as a cook
for 2 more years, until a mafia boss shows

00:06:46.949 --> 00:06:48.360
up at the restaurant.

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:52.889
He tells Sanji that he is going to be married,
unless he wants all of the cooks on the ship

00:06:52.889 --> 00:06:53.949
to die.

00:06:53.949 --> 00:06:57.460
Sanji complies and is taken to Whole Cake
Island.

00:06:57.460 --> 00:07:02.650
Here he is humiliated by his family, before
Big Mom’s crew murders the entire family

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.340
at the wedding and takes Germa’s technology.

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:09.240
Meanwhile, Nami’s village is never freed
from Arlong’s rule.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:13.150
His men come to confiscate all the money she
has saved up so far.

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:19.030
Despite her despair, she can’t let her people
down, so she keeps drawing more and more maps

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:22.930
for Arlong, locked in her tiny room inside
his castle.

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:27.880
At this point, Luffy and his crew enter the
Grandline and are starting to make a name

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.680
for themselves as Rookies.

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:35.130
Without Luffy however, Crocus has met Ace,
but wasn’t of any real help, as he was with

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:36.130
Whitebeard.

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:40.539
Laboon keeps smashing his head against the
red line until he finally succumbs to his

00:07:40.539 --> 00:07:41.539
injuries.

00:07:41.539 --> 00:07:45.419
Brook will never be able to keep his promise
with the whale.

00:07:45.419 --> 00:07:50.379
On Drum island, Chopper lives his life with
Kureha, scared and unsure about where he belongs

00:07:50.379 --> 00:07:52.770
in this world as a monster and outcast.

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:57.690
When Wapol returns to the country, he kicks
him and Kureha out of the castle and both

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.240
of them have to live under his tyranny.

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:05.169
Ace still comes to Drum however, looking for
Blackbeard, who has taken the Yami Yami no

00:08:05.169 --> 00:08:09.919
mi and betrayed the crew.

00:08:09.919 --> 00:08:15.240
In the meantime, Crocodile is able to overthrow
Alabasta without any major issues.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:19.720
He kills the king and vivi and finds the secret
chamber.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:26.800
Here, either Robin refuses to tell him about
Pluton and is killed, or she does tell him

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:32.690
the truth: That Pluton is located under the
country of Wano in the new world, under the

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:34.360
control of Kaido.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:38.740
Crocodile manages to build his power from
here much faster than if he had been caught

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.100
and brought to Impel Down.

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:42.780
He prepares a plan to take on Kaido.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:47.290
Robin meanwhile Robin goes her own separate
path, but is sooner or later captured by the

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:51.610
agents of CP9 or CP0 and brought to Impel
Down as well.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:53.670
The last scholar of Ohara.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:58.470
She will never find out that Saul is still
alive, or that the library of ohara has been

00:08:58.470 --> 00:08:59.470
saved.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:04.350
Instead she fully vanishes into the darkness
of her heart and the depths of level 6 in

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.350
Impel Down.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:08.380
Skypea is actually quite interesting.

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:14.040
Without Luffy’s interference, Enel is God
for a while longer, before making his way

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:17.730
to the moon anyways, this time accompanied
by his men.

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:20.970
Also Bellamy gets to keep all his teeth.

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:25.220
On Water seven, Franky is simply living his
delinquent life as head of the Franky family.

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:32.410
At some point, Lucci and the other CP9 agents
find out that he has the plans for Pluton.

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:37.529
Franky heroically burns the plans in front
of Lucci’s eyes, but is executed by the

00:09:37.529 --> 00:09:41.640
furious agent, who has turned into a giant
Leopard.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.180
Meanwhile Shanks is once again meeting with
Whitebeard.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:48.910
He is here to talk about Blackbeard and urges
Newgate to call Ace back.

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.410
He is way too important to die.

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:56.780
In the florian triangle, Brook spends the
next year alone in the dark without his shadow.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:10:02.190
Moria grows his Zombie army and finds a suitable
shadow for Oars.

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:09.520
He takes thriller bark to the new world and
attacks Wano once again, convinced he can

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:10.520
win.

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:14.720
However, even with Oar’s reanimated Corpse,
he can’t stand up to the might of the beast

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:15.720
pirates.

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:20.180
While he is able to enter the country and
lay siege to the flower capital, once Orochi

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:26.240
calls for help, Kaido and the all stars swoop
in and ultimately defeat his army in less

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.890
than 10 minutes.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.980
Brook’s shadow is released.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:34.080
He goes on to become a rock start.

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:43.709
Meanwhile, Onimaru buries Ryuma’s corpse
back at his grave and lies Shisui on top.

00:10:43.709 --> 00:10:46.579
The tragedy on Sabaody Archapelago never happens.

00:10:46.579 --> 00:10:52.510
A bunch of rookies, known as the worst generation
meet here and then move on to the new world.

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:56.110
Camie isn’t saved by Rayleigh and is sold
to Carlos.

00:10:56.110 --> 00:11:01.960
Rayleigh is seeing Whitebeard to urge him
that Ace as the next Joy Boy, has to become

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.690
pirate king.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:08.310
Whitebeard reveals, that he was planning to
make Ace his successor all along.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:13.100
That Roger had told him the truth about the
D Clan and his son, and that he simply had

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:16.180
wanted to make sure Ace is ready.

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:18.080
But it’s too late.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:23.430
Ace confronts Blackbeard and is captured and
taken to Impel Down.

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:29.790
Jinbei and Ivankov never escape the prison
until much later, when Morley comes for them.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.589
Jinbei becomes a revolutionary.

00:11:32.589 --> 00:11:38.850
And so, even without Luffy, the war at Marineford
still happens.

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:42.610
Blackbeard tries to sneak into Impel Down
to get the level 6 prisoners for his crew.

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:47.860
But without Luffy’s uprising and Shiriyu
being released to stop them, Magellan wipes

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.200
out the entire crew.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.560
This time there is no antidote.

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:56.240
Blackbeard had made one gamble too much and
lost to fate.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:12:03.060
The most likely candidate for pirate king
has died without anyone even realizing it.

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:08.800
Meanwhile, at Marineford, the war is about
to begin, but this time things are very different.

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:14.220
Rayleigh and most of the remaining Roger pirates
have come to fight side by side with Whitebeard

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:20.089
to free Joy Boy, the one hope to change the
world, that they have been working towards

00:12:20.089 --> 00:12:23.120
so carefully for 20 years.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:26.720
Shanks and his crew also join the war right
from the start.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.820
It’s all or nothing.

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:33.370
At first, the two Yonko crews seem to have
the upper hand, easily breaching the first

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:34.600
few lines of defenses.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:40.170
Mihawk has refused to come and fight against
his friend.

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:47.160
However suddenly the sky blackens as a gigantic
azure dragon appears over the navy headquartes

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:50.750
and a fleet of ships appears on the horizon.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:55.220
Because Shanks never went to stop him, Kaido
has decided to join the war and make it the

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:58.540
biggest battle the world has ever seen.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:01.130
He wants to draw out joy boy.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:06.470
And now we have 3 parties fighting the war.

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:10.180
Sengoku orders Ace to be executed right now.

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:16.190
Shanks uses his Haki to temporarily knock
out almost every single person on the battlefield,

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:22.269
except the other 2 Yonko, Rayleigh, the admirals
and sengoku and garp.

00:13:22.269 --> 00:13:28.490
Kaido asks Shanks if he could be Joy boy,
to which Shanks yells that it’s Ace not

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:29.490
him.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:32.850
Kaido is shocked by this, but it’s too late.

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:38.970
Akainu has returned to the execution platform
and Ace dies the same way he did last time,

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:43.240
this time not able to give his life for his
little brother.

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:47.290
The entire battlefield falls into an eerie
silence.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:54.100
Then suddenly Ace begins to melt, as a drum
starts to play.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:59.960
Ace, just like Luffy has died and thus awakened
his legendary devil fruit.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:02.540
Joy Boy has returned.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:06.690
With an awakened ace, who already is quite
a lot older and stronger than Luffy was at

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:10.550
this point, the tide of the battle quickly
turns.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:14.009
Kaido has decided to join their side for now.

00:14:14.009 --> 00:14:17.440
He had been waiting for Joy Boy’s return
his entire life.

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:23.079
However as the marines and Shichibukai are
about to be defeated, a dark shadow falls

00:14:23.079 --> 00:14:25.110
on the island.

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:27.680
Something is above the clouds.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:29.810
Then a bright light, like the sun.

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.820
And Marineford island never existed.

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:37.150
Imu and the Gorosei have decided to sacrifice
their strongest fighters in order to take

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:42.310
out 3 Yonkos and Joy Boy in one foul swoop.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:48.740
In the aftermath of the war, the last standing
Yonko is now Big Mom, who collects Shank’s

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:52.170
and Kaido’s Road Poneglyphs and takes over
Wano ann Elbaf.

00:14:52.170 --> 00:15:00.529
With Orochi by her side, 2 years later, she
learns the location of Zou from Kanjuro and

00:15:00.529 --> 00:15:03.680
takes the last poneglyph as well.

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:08.380
Using Pudding’s abilities she is able to
decipher the hidden location of Laugh Tale

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:11.779
and is crowned QUeen of the pirates.

00:15:11.779 --> 00:15:18.519
However, as she reads Joy Boy’s words, she
realizes that she can’t change the world

00:15:18.519 --> 00:15:20.190
without the Nika Fruit.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:25.589
